      "message": "How about\n* SUITE_PPM (ppm_common, ppm_driver, pdc),\n* SUITE_PPM_STATE_MACHINE (ppm_common),\n* SUITE_PPM_DRIVER (ppm_driver)\n\n? SUITE_PPM is meant to test our PPM implementation holistically.",
